# Golden verification data — source notice

`probes.csv` is a distilled snapshot of real DeepSeek V4 Pro / V4 Flash
single-request probe runs from:

- **Repository:** [yjh051108/dsh-router-standard](https://github.com/yjh051108/dsh-router-standard)
- **Path:** `probe/results/*.json`
- **License:** MIT (original data files preserved in that repository)

Each row keeps the ground-truth lexicon classification (`truth`) from the
source (minimal-like / standard-like / ambiguous) plus the wording metrics
this plugin consumes (we, letMe, lets, i, chars, firstToken) and the probe
cell id + model. Reasoning text is not included (aggregates only), consistent
with the upstream repository's own sanitization policy.

Used by `test/golden-verify.test.js` to verify the plugin's judgment against
real model behavior. To refresh the snapshot, re-download
`probe/results/*.json` from the source repository and re-run the distillation
step (see the test file header for the mapping).
